# Go build artefacts
/app
*.test
*.out
.tilt/
.tiltbuild/
.DS_Store

# Vendored Helm sub-charts — populated by `rda new` (and refreshed by
# `rda upgrade`) from the bundle's library-chart/. No need to track.
deploy/charts/
deploy/Chart.lock

# rda-managed overlay (rda-cli v0.1.38+). Holds the services[] DSL
# projection that Helm reads alongside deploy/values.yaml. Regenerated
# on every `rda render` — including by the Tilt extension before each
# `helm template` and by `rda promote` as a pre-flight step. Production
# paths (Fleet, CI helm install) get the overlay produced by their own
# `rda promote`, never the checked-in copy.
deploy/.rda/

# Buildpack outputs
*.cnb
